{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The First Light Novel-style Immersive Detective Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/extras/8c1675740f8340210304122abaf2c579.avif?t=1758371356\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious girl suddenly visited your detective agency, offering to be your &quot;unpaid assistant&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the sheriff's arrival brought a bizarre case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A resident was found dead in his room, the doors and windows sealed shut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire apartment, punctuated by a series of interlocking testimonies, has become a locked room, impenetrable to outsiders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this double-locked room, why did the deceased commit suicide? And was it truly suicide?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it was murder, who is the murderer hiding among the neighbors?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An approachable merchant, a carefree unemployed, a naive actress, a intelligent salaryman. Who is lying?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, who is this girl, whose origins she can't even explain by herself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answers to these questions are up to you to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/extras/eb6da7b0699edcb1c90a94410e23f7f5.avif?t=1758371356\" width=1500 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The murder is among them. Perhaps?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;How Many Secrets Under Ceiling&quot; is written by a new writer with Gentosha Mystery Fiction Award, based on<i> <strong>The Walker on the Ceiling</strong></i> by <strong>Edogawa Ranpo</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you don't need to play the role of anyone else; simply be your authentic self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll make choices based on your own logic, preferences, and even your personal values, solving puzzle after puzzle, navigating danger after danger, and having your every thought validated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Honkaku Mystery is written in the style of a light novel, making you always smile!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lively dialogue and banter save you from all the unhappiness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+ Personality Options, be your unique self!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/extras/fdd96218e3ea7c9c76a513a11e189b98.poster.avif?t=1758371356\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/extras/fdd96218e3ea7c9c76a513a11e189b98.webm?t=1758371356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/extras/fdd96218e3ea7c9c76a513a11e189b98.mp4?t=1758371356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+ Logical Puzzles. Let's challenge with hardcore key reasoning!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/extras/ef3659f4229c386bf7cd9167edf436ab.poster.avif?t=1758371356\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/extras/ef3659f4229c386bf7cd9167edf436ab.webm?t=1758371356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/extras/ef3659f4229c386bf7cd9167edf436ab.mp4?t=1758371356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+ Action Options, Move freely</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/extras/459ee0287a7d00e0fa6d4fc7bc915a2a.poster.avif?t=1758371356\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/extras/459ee0287a7d00e0fa6d4fc7bc915a2a.webm?t=1758371356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/extras/459ee0287a7d00e0fa6d4fc7bc915a2a.mp4?t=1758371356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professional file &amp; information summary</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/extras/2ff80e5a780242cf77705936018cf623.poster.avif?t=1758371356\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/extras/2ff80e5a780242cf77705936018cf623.webm?t=1758371356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/extras/2ff80e5a780242cf77705936018cf623.mp4?t=1758371356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80,000-word script and 5 endings to save you from all the unhappiness! 30+ delicate illustrations waiting for you to unlock!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please accept this challenge, my great detective!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>PS.</i></strong><i> The game supports four languages: English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese and Japanese, which can be freely set within the game system.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each language has been adapted to the local culture, with jokes and humor infused to suit the language.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Playing through different languages twice or three times will double the fun!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official Email: <u><a href=\"mailto:3911407996@qq.com\">3911407996@qq.com</a></u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943100?t=1758371356","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/8aa3fc2067361b38796045ab3e8ea345a964329c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758371356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/d0736f56bc66de9f5b36b597d0a78e7385216527/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758371356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943100/d0736f56bc66de9f5b36b597d0a78e7385216527/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758371356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Captions available","id":13}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The First Light Novel-style Immersive Detective Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/394310